{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案，在高等法院開審。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">案中三名被告，包括蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智、前大伯鄺港傑及前家翁鄺球，由囚車押送到高等法院。案件由暫委法官祁彥輝審理，預計審訊45日，安排正庭及延伸庭讓公眾旁聽。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">三名被告各被控一項謀殺罪，指他們涉嫌2023年2月在大埔龍尾村謀殺蔡天鳳。三人另外被控一項阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.C.MURDER-0930_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026LEGNkTvVy41789963929.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.C.MURDER-0930_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T04:38:29.783296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}